      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_13",
      "quote": "For this second update of the review, we included studies from searches up to 27 April 2021... No language restrictions were applied.",
      "reason": "Language (no restrictions) and search date cutoff are reported, and non-published reports were sought, but explicit criteria for publication type/status (e.g., whether preprints, letters, or conference abstracts were eligible) are not fully specified."
